ies":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"dfqIU-iEqKh1Id8p3gDO5g","review_id":"-JN4NCiXTf9NfT_MjWZWYA","date":"2018-12-01T04:23:18","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9454567432403564,"text_excerpt":"Im glad someone from the area told me about this place because when you walk past you would not expect it to sell hot food. Nonetheless, we went in and ordered some fried chicken. At the time we ordered our wings they were cooking some so we waited until they were done. Got back to the hotel and gave it a try. OMG-it was awesome. Better than Popeyes (in our opinion). Crispy, flavorful, not overly greasy. It was so good we went back the next day. When we got there they had chicken that had been out for a bit but we asked for some freshly prepared and the young lady told us when they would make some fresh wings so we came back (our hotel was only a little over a block away) and once again, ..."},{"business_id":"dfqIU-iEqKh1Id8p3gDO5g","review_id":"6Gn8ptvdC4u1DCXgP1vPWA","date":"2014-04-14T13:19:05","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9396343231201172,"text_excerpt":"My friends suggested Brother's after Wrestlemania because they have great fried chicken. I had not yet had fried chicken during my stay in NOLA so I figured what the hell and followed them. From the outside, this place looks like Wawa and 7-11 had a baby. Inside it's pretty much the same. Aisles of snacks and knick knacks, fridges full of beverages. Then there's a long line, a line to fried chicken! They have quite a few options available: 2-piece white, 2-piece mixed, 2-piece dark....Followed by 3-piece combo meals paired with fries. They also offer livers but I wasn't in the mood at 11PM. There is no place to sit since at the end of it all, it's still a mini-mart. We brought it back to ..."},{"business_id":"dfqIU-iEqKh1Id8p3gDO5g","review_id":"DMSlShYyUWWKNmwvd3HCkQ","date":"2015-09-21T03:23:41","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9387972354888916,"text_excerpt":"After walking around the French Quarter and making our way back to our hotel room, we were waiting at an intersection when a block down, the Brothers Food Mart sign caught my attention. More so the fried chicken signage directly below it since I always have food on my mind, lol. It sounded familiar to me, but wasn't sure why. It wasn't until I later read a list of suggestions (when I got back to the hotel) that my fellow Yelp friend/NOLA resident, Lyn P. recommended this spot. We love fried chicken, so we gave it a try. For $4.29, you can get a two piece dark meat meal combo that came with one side. I ordered mine with steak fries with seasonings and the hubby originally wanted mashed pot..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"dfqIU-iEqKh1Id8p3gDO5g","photo_id":"CTumIq3aBdux4JBw51cB7Q","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/CTumIq3aBdux4JBw51cB7Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8751183152198792},{"business_id":"dfqIU-iEqKh1Id8p3gDO5g","photo_id":"TDsP5RMJPENQhDbyl9N_VQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/TDsP5RMJPENQhDbyl9N_VQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8715400695800781},{"business_id":"dfqIU-iEqKh1Id8p3gDO5g","photo_id":"HFYWMhlUCT2--UOlUMFFpA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/HFYWMhlUCT2--UOlUMFFpA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8664034605026245},{"business_id":"dfqIU-iEqKh1Id8p3gDO5g","photo_id":"1yX_E6J_5L-fsApQcbAyLw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/1yX_E6J_5L-f